    "Some fur is singed."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1574
translate spanish nikroute4a_2e80e050:

    # "The temperature of the room as a whole rises."
    "The temperature of the room as a whole rises."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1575
translate spanish nikroute4a_468a4c2c:

    # "People start to scream as more rock catches aflame."
    "People start to scream as more rock catches aflame."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1576
translate spanish nikroute4a_1aa5397c:

    # "The smoke level is past some people’s heads and I’m surrounded by coughing."
    "The smoke level is past some people’s heads and I’m surrounded by coughing."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1577
translate spanish nikroute4a_8bb23b47:

    # "Choking."
    "Choking."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1578
translate spanish nikroute4a_c7781cb1:

    # "People crawl over one another, trying to climb rocks, or one another."
    "People crawl over one another, trying to climb rocks, or one another."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1579
translate spanish nikroute4a_33667931:

    # "But some people start to stick together as they burn."
    "But some people start to stick together as they burn."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1580
translate spanish nikroute4a_dc605618:

    # "Nik takes my hand and charges me through the cave."
    "Nik takes my hand and charges me through the cave."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1581
translate spanish nikroute4a_ff859cac:

    # "Some people see us and cry out, following us, yelling words we don’t understand."
    "Some people see us and cry out, following us, yelling words we don’t understand."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1583
translate spanish nikroute4a_3dbd15b6:

    # m "\"Nik, you’re following the flames!\""
    m "\"Nik, you’re following the flames!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1584
translate spanish nikroute4a_2b5fbf45:

    # ni "\"Yes!\""
    ni "\"Yes!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1585
translate spanish nikroute4a_cd619344:

    # m "\"We’ll die!\""
    m "\"We’ll die!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1587
translate spanish nikroute4a_7ca46e41:

    # ni "\"No, we die if we stay!\""
    ni "\"No, we die if we stay!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1590
translate spanish nikroute4a_0c60dafd:

    # "Somehow, we come to a staircase on the other side of the room."
    "Somehow, we come to a staircase on the other side of the room."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1591
translate spanish nikroute4a_735497e9:

    # "But there’s an iron gate behind it."
    "But there’s an iron gate behind it."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1592
translate spanish nikroute4a_1ba97d2f:

    # "And it’s closed."
    "And it’s closed."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1594
translate spanish nikroute4a_839a6d64:

    # "Nikolai stops in his tracks."
    "Nikolai stops in his tracks."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1595
translate spanish nikroute4a_74141210:

    # "I wonder if he feels defeated again, if only for a moment."
    "I wonder if he feels defeated again, if only for a moment."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1596
translate spanish nikroute4a_b01efa74:

    # "But I realize that he’s hesitating."
    "But I realize that he’s hesitating."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1597
translate spanish nikroute4a_907c3916:

    # "The men who followed us run ahead of him, going for the grate."
    "The men who followed us run ahead of him, going for the grate."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1599
translate spanish nikroute4a_44ed2593:

    # ni "\"Do NOT!\""
    ni "\"Do NOT!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1600
translate spanish nikroute4a_6759eac7:

    # "But again, he’s ignored."
    "But again, he’s ignored."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1604
translate spanish nikroute4a_609c4581:

    # "People scream as their paws fry around the grate of the opening, sticking to the hot metal."
    "People scream as their paws fry around the grate of the opening, sticking to the hot metal."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1606
translate spanish nikroute4a_015f3eb5:

    # "Their hands wind together, fusing to the iron, flesh melting off the digits of their paws, all grasping at the other side, hunting for some latch, or some lever that will lift the hot bars and let them climb."
    "Their hands wind together, fusing to the iron, flesh melting off the digits of their paws, all grasping at the other side, hunting for some latch, or some lever that will lift the hot bars and let them climb."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1607
translate spanish nikroute4a_ae05392b:

    # "And then a terrible feeling comes over me."
    "And then a terrible feeling comes over me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1608
translate spanish nikroute4a_87c926c7:

    # "A feeling like I’ve been here before."
    "A feeling like I’ve been here before."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1609
translate spanish nikroute4a_e880d79b:

    # "Worse than ever before."
    "Worse than ever before."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1610
translate spanish nikroute4a_23a7bfdc:

    # "The first wave of fire had to come from somewhere."
    "The first wave of fire had to come from somewhere."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1611
translate spanish nikroute4a_a7cd7248:

    # "And then something worse happens."
    "And then something worse happens."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1615
translate spanish nikroute4a_2167125d:

    # "A new vortex of flame from the mouth of the staircase swirls out, igniting the people stuck to the metal."
    "A new vortex of flame from the mouth of the staircase swirls out, igniting the people stuck to the metal."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1617
translate spanish nikroute4a_64ecc296:

    # "By the time it passes them by, their flesh is so disfigured that their faces and bodies have grafted together into a terrible mass of eyes and gaping mouths."
    "By the time it passes them by, their flesh is so disfigured that their faces and bodies have grafted together into a terrible mass of eyes and gaping mouths."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1619
translate spanish nikroute4a_11b36073:

    # "Whatever the nature of this chamber was, it feels as if it's shifting."
    "Whatever the nature of this chamber was, it feels as if it's shifting."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1620
translate spanish nikroute4a_ae5b5744:

    # "Blue shadows give way to scarlet miasmas."
    "Blue shadows give way to scarlet miasmas."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1621
translate spanish nikroute4a_68eb2da9:

    # "Flames color the stone ceiling a deep, vast, red, almost as if it were the sky itself, on fire."
    "Flames color the stone ceiling a deep, vast, red, almost as if it were the sky itself, on fire."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1622
translate spanish nikroute4a_96788bd1:

    # "If what was here was sleeping, it now feels fully awake, and it sips in the screams, sucks up the melting organs."
    "If what was here was sleeping, it now feels fully awake, and it sips in the screams, sucks up the melting organs."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1623
translate spanish nikroute4a_cd6d0521:

    # "It’s the worst thing I’ve ever seen in my life."
    "It’s the worst thing I’ve ever seen in my life."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1626
translate spanish nikroute4a_14c7702c:

    # ni "\"DON’T LOOK!\""
    ni "\"DON’T LOOK!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1628
translate spanish nikroute4a_8f5bb925:

    # "Nik takes me by the arms and pulls me up around his neck."
    "Nik takes me by the arms and pulls me up around his neck."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1630
translate spanish nikroute4a_2743c398:

    # "Somehow, we’re climbing now."
    "Somehow, we’re climbing now."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1631
translate spanish nikroute4a_9fc2eebe:

    # "The fire hasn’t gotten to him yet."
    "The fire hasn’t gotten to him yet."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1632
translate spanish nikroute4a_9208ab3b:

    # "He’s still whole."
    "He’s still whole."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1633
translate spanish nikroute4a_d3489252:

    # "Still mine."
    "Still mine."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1634
translate spanish nikroute4a_b3409346:

    # m "\"Hey, Nik?\""
    m "\"Hey, Nik?\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1635
translate spanish nikroute4a_552abc1f:

    # "He doesn’t answer."
    "He doesn’t answer."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1636
translate spanish nikroute4a_b672a3a4:

    # m "\"Did you know that you were the best friend that somebody like me could have had?\""
    m "\"Did you know that you were the best friend that somebody like me could have had?\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1637
translate spanish nikroute4a_d6f78140:

    # ni "\"Stop speaking.\""
    ni "\"Stop speaking.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1638
translate spanish nikroute4a_9228fa09:

    # m "\"But I want to say what I need to before the smoke catches up.\""
    m "\"But I want to say what I need to before the smoke catches up.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1639
translate spanish nikroute4a_60d05f9b:

    # ni "\"We can talk after we get you out of here.\""
    ni "\"We can talk after we get you out of here.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1640
translate spanish nikroute4a_6016bd54:

    # m "\"But I’m not getting out of here, am I, Nik?\""
    m "\"But I’m not getting out of here, am I, Nik?\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1641
translate spanish nikroute4a_807cd9e4:

    # "He ignores me as he reaches his hands up."
    "He ignores me as he reaches his hands up."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1643
translate spanish nikroute4a_c780f2d1:

    # "Clawing away the rocks with his sharp claws."
    "Clawing away the rocks with his sharp claws."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1644
translate spanish nikroute4a_36bb06c1:

    # "I can see now where we are."
    "I can see now where we are."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1645
translate spanish nikroute4a_63e61309:

    # "We’re several feet above the iron gate."
    "We’re several feet above the iron gate."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1646
translate spanish nikroute4a_daf10834:

    # "There’s a weak point in the stone wall."
    "There’s a weak point in the stone wall."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1647
translate spanish nikroute4a_5263da2d:

    # "Nik is holding onto it with the pick we used to open Yao’s crate."
    "Nik is holding onto it with the pick we used to open Yao’s crate."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1648
translate spanish nikroute4a_d8511753:

    # m "\"I wasted too much time chasing a dream, Nik.\""
    m "\"I wasted too much time chasing a dream, Nik.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1650
translate spanish nikroute4a_b2e13fd2:

    # "We can see a some loose stone."
    "We can see a some loose stone."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1651
translate spanish nikroute4a_a915490d:

    # m "\"I wanted respect.\""
    m "\"I wanted respect.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1654
translate spanish nikroute4a_307bd521:

    # "He beats away the loose stone with his paws, and it falls loose from the damp earth, revealing iron bars that block another way into the stairs."
    "He beats away the loose stone with his paws, and it falls loose from the damp earth, revealing iron bars that block another way into the stairs."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1656
translate spanish nikroute4a_35b14160:

    # m "\"I wanted money.\""
    m "\"I wanted money.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1657
translate spanish nikroute4a_b6d0446c:

    # "The smoke has already risen thick at our feet."
    "The smoke has already risen thick at our feet."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1658
translate spanish nikroute4a_530b3d43:

    # "The last we hear of Paul is below us at the gate."
    "The last we hear of Paul is below us at the gate."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1659
translate spanish nikroute4a_7cbb80e3:

    # "He’s trying to help open it with the others who have been disfigured."
    "He’s trying to help open it with the others who have been disfigured."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1660
translate spanish nikroute4a_4e7e09d8:

    # "But the smoke gets so thick we can’t see them anymore."
    "But the smoke gets so thick we can’t see them anymore."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1661
translate spanish nikroute4a_f5eb5014:

    # ni "\"If we break through we can open it from the other side.\""
    ni "\"If we break through we can open it from the other side.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1662
translate spanish nikroute4a_46de8998:

    # "I don’t know if he’s listening anymore."
    "I don’t know if he’s listening anymore."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1663
translate spanish nikroute4a_621a678f:

    # "But I still need him to hear this."
    "But I still need him to hear this."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1664
translate spanish nikroute4a_816509e9:

    # "I need him to hear this before the end of him, and me, and every trace we have of one another."
    "I need him to hear this before the end of him, and me, and every trace we have of one another."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1665
translate spanish nikroute4a_0818b8a0:

    # m "\"I wanted to live the end of my life out in light and glamor.\""
    m "\"I wanted to live the end of my life out in light and glamor.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1666
translate spanish nikroute4a_9eab595a:

    # m "\"And I wasted it when I could have spent that time with you.\""
    m "\"And I wasted it when I could have spent that time with you.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1667
translate spanish nikroute4a_da67e436:

    # "He starts beating the iron blocking our way with his fist."
    "He starts beating the iron blocking our way with his fist."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1668
translate spanish nikroute4a_4005f9f1:

    # "Beating it until his paws bleed."
    "Beating it until his paws bleed."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1669
translate spanish nikroute4a_f93e9428:

    # "The smoke is at our shoulders now."
    "The smoke is at our shoulders now."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1670
translate spanish nikroute4a_ca5625d7:

    # m "\"I love you, Nikolai Król.\""
    m "\"I love you, Nikolai Król.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1671
translate spanish nikroute4a_02a24413:

    # ni "\"I SAID.\""
    ni "\"I SAID.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1674
translate spanish nikroute4a_796ffa9b:

    # "The badger crouches, and jumps, bashing his skull into the iron." with vpunch
    "The badger crouches, and jumps, bashing his skull into the iron." with vpunch

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1676
translate spanish nikroute4a_1b49f43f:

    # m "\"STOP!\""
    m "\"STOP!\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1677
translate spanish nikroute4a_d54ce6f3:

    # "He leaves a massive dent in the bar."
    "He leaves a massive dent in the bar."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1680
translate spanish nikroute4a_1c0f3f5a:

    # ni "\"I’M GETTING YOU!\"" with vpunch
    ni "\"I’M GETTING YOU!\"" with vpunch

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1681
translate spanish nikroute4a_6dc7e9bd:

    # "The second leaves the bar curves and his forehead bloody."
    "The second leaves the bar curves and his forehead bloody."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1684
translate spanish nikroute4a_97d19d34:

    # ni "\"OUT!\"" with vpunch
    ni "\"OUT!\"" with vpunch

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1688
translate spanish nikroute4a_26a4a86d:

    # "I can’t stop him."
    "I can’t stop him."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1690
translate spanish nikroute4a_9769ae4d:

    # "It pops off with the third hit."
    "It pops off with the third hit."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1692
translate spanish nikroute4a_a0f7e614:

    # "He grabs me by the waist and pushes me up, onto the stone staircase, hacking, coughing, and then slumps."
    "He grabs me by the waist and pushes me up, onto the stone staircase, hacking, coughing, and then slumps."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1693
translate spanish nikroute4a_dd29ef61:

    # "The smoke isn’t as bad at this level yet."
    "The smoke isn’t as bad at this level yet."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1694
translate spanish nikroute4a_482daf91:

    # "Nik got me out, away from the others, just like he promised."
    "Nik got me out, away from the others, just like he promised."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1695
translate spanish nikroute4a_825fd777:

    # "But he isn’t moving."
    "But he isn’t moving."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1696
translate spanish nikroute4a_09cabe42:

    # "He isn’t even breathing."
    "He isn’t even breathing."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1699
translate spanish nikroute4a_5fb70a9d:

    # "Above me, I see another terrible flash of white."
    "Above me, I see another terrible flash of white."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1700
translate spanish nikroute4a_d26f842f:

    # "A pillar of fire is coming for me, and for Nik."
    "A pillar of fire is coming for me, and for Nik."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1701
translate spanish nikroute4a_1674190f:

    # "I’m grateful that at least Nik won’t feel it."
    "I’m grateful that at least Nik won’t feel it."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1702
translate spanish nikroute4a_4349b456:

    # "I reach through the grating of the stairs and hold onto his paws."
    "I reach through the grating of the stairs and hold onto his paws."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1703
translate spanish nikroute4a_93397fa0:

    # "Just to squeeze them one last time."
    "Just to squeeze them one last time."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1705
translate spanish nikroute4a_4e45af13:

    # "Then I close my eyes and wait."
    "Then I close my eyes and wait."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1707
translate spanish nikroute4a_d83b3791:

    # "But something’s wrong."
    "But something’s wrong."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1708
translate spanish nikroute4a_bffdbbd2:

    # "I look around me."
    "I look around me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1710
translate spanish nikroute4a_458ddcee:

    # "I’m in the dark."
    "I’m in the dark."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1711
translate spanish nikroute4a_ef52a7d4:

    # "The air is cool, and wet, and I hear that gentle thrumming."
    "The air is cool, and wet, and I hear that gentle thrumming."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1712
translate spanish nikroute4a_283adf18:

    # "It’s that terrible, hollow earth sound."
    "It’s that terrible, hollow earth sound."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1713
translate spanish nikroute4a_95a9b0f0:

    # "But right now, for some reason, it puts me at ease."
    "But right now, for some reason, it puts me at ease."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1714
translate spanish nikroute4a_1a8a31c1:

    # "It’s my only reminder that, right now, somehow, my blood still runs through me."
    "It’s my only reminder that, right now, somehow, my blood still runs through me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1715
translate spanish nikroute4a_4f4202ed:

    # "I look about me as I let my eyes adjust."
    "I look about me as I let my eyes adjust."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1717
translate spanish nikroute4a_c6a84c57:

    # "But I see nobody in this place."
    "But I see nobody in this place."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1718
translate spanish nikroute4a_4f467df7:

    # "And nothing but an endless expanse with rays of light that bounce, almost gracefully, off of materials I ain't ever seen the likeness of before, them being more liquid than rock, both solid and wet and formless and smooth."
    "And nothing but an endless expanse with rays of light that bounce, almost gracefully, off of materials I ain't ever seen the likeness of before, them being more liquid than rock, both solid and wet and formless and smooth."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1719
translate spanish nikroute4a_b06b8fc3:

    # "But a voice speaks, and anything capable of glimmering in the room gives light, like molten gold running through liquid marble."
    "But a voice speaks, and anything capable of glimmering in the room gives light, like molten gold running through liquid marble."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1720
translate spanish nikroute4a_db32e1fa:

    # no3a "\"Life is not constant.\""
    no3a "\"Life is not constant.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1721
translate spanish nikroute4a_8f92df55:

    # "A voice reaches out to me."
    "A voice reaches out to me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1722
translate spanish nikroute4a_9aaa161e:

    # no3a "\"Death is not constant.\""
    no3a "\"Death is not constant.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1723
translate spanish nikroute4a_d2afe3eb:

    # "A happy voice."
    "A happy voice."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1724
translate spanish nikroute4a_8f926432:

    # no3a "\"You, yourself, are not constant.\""
    no3a "\"You, yourself, are not constant.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1725
translate spanish nikroute4a_9cd658e4:

    # "A content voice."
    "A content voice."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1726
translate spanish nikroute4a_d33b4f03:

    # "A voice I have heard before."
    "A voice I have heard before."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1727
translate spanish nikroute4a_0314e377:

    # "But something has changed about it since the last time I heard it."
    "But something has changed about it since the last time I heard it."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1728
translate spanish nikroute4a_4769ab58:

    # "It no longer sounds crackled, or dry."
    "It no longer sounds crackled, or dry."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1729
translate spanish nikroute4a_d120a0c0:

    # "It sounds rich, and playful."
    "It sounds rich, and playful."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1730
translate spanish nikroute4a_def40cd6:

    # "Almost comforting."
    "Almost comforting."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1731
translate spanish nikroute4a_34dfa883:

    # no3a "\"Be not afraid.\""
    no3a "\"Be not afraid.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1732
translate spanish nikroute4a_2f2e4b2b:

    # no3a "\"For this time, in solitude, you are saved.\""
    no3a "\"For this time, in solitude, you are saved.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1733
translate spanish nikroute4a_36ebfa47:

    # "I wait in silence, almost eager, for my next message."
    "I wait in silence, almost eager, for my next message."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1734
translate spanish nikroute4a_bf2f71ac:

    # "Because I am so happy that we are still here."
    "Because I am so happy that we are still here."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1735
translate spanish nikroute4a_a625fae3:

    # "That time continues for us, like a clock not yet broken."
    "That time continues for us, like a clock not yet broken."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1736
translate spanish nikroute4a_17b4b1e4:

    # "Though I do not know who us is."
    "Though I do not know who us is."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1737
translate spanish nikroute4a_626fb3aa:

    # "All I can feel is that my dread wanes."
    "All I can feel is that my dread wanes."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1738
translate spanish nikroute4a_f11c66e8:

    # no3a "\"Now remember.\""
    no3a "\"Now remember.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1739
translate spanish nikroute4a_38344c7b:

    # "And the voice comes back to me, pouring down my ear, like some secret music composed for the architecture of my body, alone, thrumming through the chambers of my heart, and plucking at the string of every nerve."
    "And the voice comes back to me, pouring down my ear, like some secret music composed for the architecture of my body, alone, thrumming through the chambers of my heart, and plucking at the string of every nerve."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1740
translate spanish nikroute4a_420f70d7:

    # no3a "\"There is only one constant in all of creation.\""
    no3a "\"There is only one constant in all of creation.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1741
translate spanish nikroute4a_7c7c15e5:

    # "The warmth."
    "The warmth."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1742
translate spanish nikroute4a_9256462f:

    # "The light."
    "The light."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1743
translate spanish nikroute4a_05732cd1:

    # "The safety."
    "The safety."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1744
translate spanish nikroute4a_c4f208b7:

    # "It is overwhelming to me."
    "It is overwhelming to me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1745
translate spanish nikroute4a_b18c82b7:

    # no3a "\"And that is a meal.\""
    no3a "\"And that is a meal.\""

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1748
translate spanish nikroute4a_cdd35207:

    # "The light in the chamber goes out."
    "The light in the chamber goes out."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1749
translate spanish nikroute4a_86578f33:

    # "As soon as they had come, those lovely, bubbly, calming thoughts leave me."
    "As soon as they had come, those lovely, bubbly, calming thoughts leave me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1750
translate spanish nikroute4a_1da50458:

    # "The sense of peace is gone."
    "The sense of peace is gone."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1751
translate spanish nikroute4a_f0c2895a:

    # "The sense of awe rushes from my veins as though every last one of them has been sliced open."
    "The sense of awe rushes from my veins as though every last one of them has been sliced open."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1754
translate spanish nikroute4a_65c11804:

    # "I wake up beneath the quivering carapace of that monster spider."
    "I wake up beneath the quivering carapace of that monster spider."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1755
translate spanish nikroute4a_a0d8c3f4:

    # "I think surely that if the flames haven’t killed me, this will be it."
    "I think surely that if the flames haven’t killed me, this will be it."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1756
translate spanish nikroute4a_a29a5a08:

    # "But it does not kill me."
    "But it does not kill me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1757
translate spanish nikroute4a_8d69ff63:

    # "It drags me by the wrist, up those winding stairs, away from the burned body of Nikolai Król, whose arms I leave outreached."
    "It drags me by the wrist, up those winding stairs, away from the burned body of Nikolai Król, whose arms I leave outreached."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1758
translate spanish nikroute4a_57fb1bf0:

    # "It takes me through parts of the earth inaccessible to those who can’t climb walls."
    "It takes me through parts of the earth inaccessible to those who can’t climb walls."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1759
translate spanish nikroute4a_fe412d5c:

    # "Scuttling."
    "Scuttling."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1760
translate spanish nikroute4a_3c7eb5e7:

    # "Slithering."
    "Slithering."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1763
translate spanish nikroute4a_e7174b94:

    # "Pushing me out of a hole in the ground in the middle of the desert."
    "Pushing me out of a hole in the ground in the middle of the desert."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1764
translate spanish nikroute4a_1285a831:

    # "It is rejecting me."
    "It is rejecting me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1765
translate spanish nikroute4a_94463644:

    # "But only me."
    "But only me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1766
translate spanish nikroute4a_a061743f:

    # "As if I were scraps."
    "As if I were scraps."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1767
translate spanish nikroute4a_525b5a1b:

    # "As if to diminish Nik’s sacrifice."
    "As if to diminish Nik’s sacrifice."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1768
translate spanish nikroute4a_000e2536:

    # "As if to say that he wasn’t why I had gotten out after all."
    "As if to say that he wasn’t why I had gotten out after all."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1769
translate spanish nikroute4a_cac1da43:

    # "But that doesn’t matter to me."
    "But that doesn’t matter to me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1770
translate spanish nikroute4a_1767b5b8:

    # "It was he who got me out of that hell."
    "It was he who got me out of that hell."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1771
translate spanish nikroute4a_4b22a940:

    # "Because he promised me that he would."
    "Because he promised me that he would."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1773
translate spanish nikroute4a_e3332959:

    # "And it’s because of him that I can see, in the distance, that the Hendricks’ manor burns, shinin’ like the world’s brightest torch."
    "And it’s because of him that I can see, in the distance, that the Hendricks’ manor burns, shinin’ like the world’s brightest torch."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1774
translate spanish nikroute4a_c68f5450:

    # "The explosion we heard below had been a house fire."
    "The explosion we heard below had been a house fire."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1775
translate spanish nikroute4a_3a54dae9:

    # "Nik put together that this was what had set the mine ablaze."
    "Nik put together that this was what had set the mine ablaze."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1776
translate spanish nikroute4a_b5a76fd3:

    # "Because Yao hadn’t been lying about the gasses."
    "Because Yao hadn’t been lying about the gasses."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1777
translate spanish nikroute4a_d1a82650:

    # "Yao’s map was trustworthy."
    "Yao’s map was trustworthy."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1778
translate spanish nikroute4a_a2ebf1bd:

    # "And Nik had trusted him."
    "And Nik had trusted him."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1779
translate spanish nikroute4a_f4c798d3:

    # "Was that why wasn’t I enough for him?"
    "Was that why wasn’t I enough for him?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1780
translate spanish nikroute4a_e06ffbb8:

    # "He wanted to save us all."
    "He wanted to save us all."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1781
translate spanish nikroute4a_dd8ba79a:

    # "Instead, he lost us."
    "Instead, he lost us."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1782
translate spanish nikroute4a_c1e79ecf:

    # "He should have been more selfish."
    "He should have been more selfish."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1783
translate spanish nikroute4a_ee6f42ff:

    # "{i}I{/i} should have been more selfish."
    "{i}I{/i} should have been more selfish."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1784
translate spanish nikroute4a_0df80af9:

    # "For a moment, I really want to believe in their dream."
    "For a moment, I really want to believe in their dream."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1785
translate spanish nikroute4a_02cefc65:

    # "But why die for a better world if none of us could make it there?"
    "But why die for a better world if none of us could make it there?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1787
translate spanish nikroute4a_2fc2324a:

    # "I sit on the metal grating, struggling to move out of the smoke, when everything I've lost catches up to me."
    "I sit on the metal grating, struggling to move out of the smoke, when everything I've lost catches up to me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1788
translate spanish nikroute4a_e34df10d:

    # "How could I have been so stupid to try and run away when the person I really wanted was here the whole time?"
    "How could I have been so stupid to try and run away when the person I really wanted was here the whole time?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1789
translate spanish nikroute4a_d1d29b54:

    # "I think about William, who protected us until the very end, until a single bullet twisted him into something lifeless and empty. "
    "I think about William, who protected us until the very end, until a single bullet twisted him into something lifeless and empty. "

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1790
translate spanish nikroute4a_199665dd:

    # "I think about Nik, my best friend, the greatest love I’ve ever known, dead with his associates, miles beneath the ground, only because he gave more and more of himself until there was nothing left."
    "I think about Nik, my best friend, the greatest love I’ve ever known, dead with his associates, miles beneath the ground, only because he gave more and more of himself until there was nothing left."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1791
translate spanish nikroute4a_bcd410b2:

    # "And how the people who made him happy are all dead."
    "And how the people who made him happy are all dead."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1792
translate spanish nikroute4a_91241bf1:

    # "At the very least, I think about how that house, and this mine, and this city will be consumed with them in this inferno."
    "At the very least, I think about how that house, and this mine, and this city will be consumed with them in this inferno."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1793
translate spanish nikroute4a_e07a8e3e:

    # "But was it worth this?"
    "But was it worth this?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1794
translate spanish nikroute4a_587bb165:

    # "Their suffering?"
    "Their suffering?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1795
translate spanish nikroute4a_467de0e4:

    # "Their unraveling?"
    "Their unraveling?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1796
translate spanish nikroute4a_6b5b8c5b:

    # "Their undoing?"
    "Their undoing?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1797
translate spanish nikroute4a_8bdd5ca4:

    # "I don’t know."
    "I don’t know."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1798
translate spanish nikroute4a_108c0419:

    # "I look again at the metal grating I sit on top of."
    "I look again at the metal grating I sit on top of."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1799
translate spanish nikroute4a_08e4d161:

    # "There, I see the hands of more men."
    "There, I see the hands of more men."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1800
translate spanish nikroute4a_742ebf3c:

    # "Men who had died in different parts of the mine, who had tried to get out."
    "Men who had died in different parts of the mine, who had tried to get out."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1801
translate spanish nikroute4a_8a5d83bd:

    # "Who were sticking their hands through the bars, searching for a latch or a weak spot in the dirt, just like the men lost at the bottom, who had all suffocated from the smoke."
    "Who were sticking their hands through the bars, searching for a latch or a weak spot in the dirt, just like the men lost at the bottom, who had all suffocated from the smoke."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1802
translate spanish nikroute4a_37bfa8f9:

    # "And I start sobbing."
    "And I start sobbing."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1803
translate spanish nikroute4a_f3ca90cb:

    # "Again, I don’t know."
    "Again, I don’t know."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1804
translate spanish nikroute4a_642eba06:

    # "But there’s one thing I know for sure, beneath the red sky, as my lungs fill with toxic smoke."
    "But there’s one thing I know for sure, beneath the red sky, as my lungs fill with toxic smoke."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1807
translate spanish nikroute4a_f52b8dd5:

    # "It feels like it’s my turn to die too."
    "It feels like it’s my turn to die too."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1808
translate spanish nikroute4a_a727bed9:

    # "But it doesn’t come to me."
    "But it doesn’t come to me."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1809
translate spanish nikroute4a_b764f455:

    # "Oh God, why doesn’t it come to me?"
    "Oh God, why doesn’t it come to me?"

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1813
translate spanish nikroute4a_6a830ba1:

    # "As I hobble toward the Hip, I find that the Hendricks’ manor isn’t the only thing caught up in this inferno."
    "As I hobble toward the Hip, I find that the Hendricks’ manor isn’t the only thing caught up in this inferno."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1814
translate spanish nikroute4a_84232f6b:

    # "The town hall and most of downtown has been caught in the flames too."
    "The town hall and most of downtown has been caught in the flames too."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1816
translate spanish nikroute4a_181c71db:

    # "The girls and the Madam are nowhere to be found."
    "The girls and the Madam are nowhere to be found."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1817
translate spanish nikroute4a_8459cfe5:

    # "Nor the mayor."
    "Nor the mayor."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1818
translate spanish nikroute4a_583adb55:

    # "Nor James or his wife."
    "Nor James or his wife."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1821
translate spanish nikroute4a_5ab74c78:

    # "But I remain."
    "But I remain."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1822
translate spanish nikroute4a_b49c5c96:

    # "Much longer after the fire goes out."
    "Much longer after the fire goes out."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1824
translate spanish nikroute4a_7a00819c:

    # "Much longer after the people here rebuild a town that is a shadow of the young city it once was."
    "Much longer after the people here rebuild a town that is a shadow of the young city it once was."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1825
translate spanish nikroute4a_2f6ad3da:

    # "And I try to forget them all."
    "And I try to forget them all."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1826
translate spanish nikroute4a_ff23838a:

    # "Because now there’s nobody to love."
    "Because now there’s nobody to love."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1827
translate spanish nikroute4a_c4484123:

    # "Nobody to hate."
    "Nobody to hate."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1828
translate spanish nikroute4a_b42845ed:

    # "Nobody to talk to or think about at all."
    "Nobody to talk to or think about at all."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1829
translate spanish nikroute4a_7b756fa5:

    # "Just an empty place, where empty things happen."
    "Just an empty place, where empty things happen."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1830
translate spanish nikroute4a_c6126b93:

    # "Where the people who know what happened pretend that they don’t."
    "Where the people who know what happened pretend that they don’t."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1831
translate spanish nikroute4a_4062f51b:

    # "And they survive as lesser versions of themselves."
    "And they survive as lesser versions of themselves."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1832
translate spanish nikroute4a_bf3c12b3:

    # "Every day, I just experience the one constant of creation."
    "Every day, I just experience the one constant of creation."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1833
translate spanish nikroute4a_ce901749:

    # "That there is a meal."
    "That there is a meal."

# game/nikroute4.rpy:1838
translate spanish nikroute4a_f01ec07a:

    # "Amen."
    "Amen."

